          "lineContent": "if err := os.Rename(tmp.Name(), dest); err != nil {",
          "title": "Atomic rename to final location",
          "description": "Move temp file to content-addressed path (sha256/\u003chex\u003e)"
        },
        {
          "id": "2f",
          "path": "internal/storage/cas/file_store.go",
          "lineNumber": 183,
          "lineContent": "if err := s.writeMetadata(meta); err != nil {",
          "title": "Write metadata JSON",
